    bloomSkill: "Analysing", questionText: "In these diagrams, the angle of refraction r has been correctly marked in which diagram?",
    options: ["I", "II", "III", "IV"],
    answer: "IV",
    solutionSteps: ["[1 mark] Correct option: IV. The angle of refraction is the angle between the refracted ray (inside the glass) and the normal at the point of incidence. Only diagram IV marks r between the ray inside the slab and the normal at the first (top) surface; the other diagrams mark angles with the slab surfaces or at the wrong boundary."],
